5
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:16,600
A person can own valuable company shares without receiving

6
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,960
that value as cash income that year.

7
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:22,740
The proposal reaches up to five percent of covered

8
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:26,790
