15
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:48,880
The detailed valuation and threshold rules matter.

16
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:52,880
Imagine a clinic planning services that need reliable funding.

17
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:56,460
If a hypothetical taxpayer has two billion dollars of

18
00:00:56,460 --> 00:01:00,340
covered taxable wealth and the full five percent rate

19
00:01:00,340 --> 00:01:04,600
applies, the tax is one hundred million dollars.

20
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:07,940
That is an illustration, not the calculation for every

21
00:01:07,940 --> 00:01:08,280
