22
00:01:09,060 --> 00:01:11,900
A budget planner considers how long new money lasts.

23
00:01:11,900 --> 00:01:14,500
Ninety percent of revenue is directed to health care;

24
00:01:15,320 --> 00:01:19,620
the remainder supports education, food assistance, and administration.

25
00:01:20,420 --> 00:01:23,700
A one-time collection spread over years still does not

26
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:26,440
