33
00:01:45,220 --> 00:01:48,420
There could also be an ongoing income-tax loss if

34
00:01:48,420 --> 00:01:51,380
wealthy residents change their behavior or leave.

35
00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:55,000
The analyst estimates that possible loss at less than

36
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,520
