53
00:02:44,980 --> 00:02:48,860
They may prefer recurring funding with fewer collection uncertainties.

54
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:52,740
These concerns do not establish that every dollar of

55
00:02:52,740 --> 00:02:54,440
projected revenue disappears.

56
